@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title test-workflow — Risk-Aware Verification and Test Quality Gate

start
:Read requirement / Slice acceptance criteria / changed behavior;
:Build Acceptance-to-Test Matrix;
:Select mandatory risk dimensions;

:Run static / type / lint / schema checks;
if (Useful failure?) then (yes)
  :Classify root cause;
  :Return FAIL / BLOCKED with evidence;
  stop
endif

:Run focused unit / component / API tests;
if (Useful failure?) then (yes)
  :Classify root cause;
  :Return FAIL / BLOCKED with evidence;
  stop
endif

:Run boundary + negative-path checks;

if (Complex input space or strong invariant?) then (yes)
  :Run property / fuzz checks;
endif

if (External or multi-module boundary touched?) then (yes)
  :Run integration / contract checks;
endif

if (High-risk logic or weak-test suspicion?) then (yes)
  :Run targeted mutation / test-strength check;
endif

:Run affected regression checks;

if (Critical browser-visible flow?) then (yes)
  :Run browser / E2E checks;
endif

if (Nondeterminism risk or intermittent failure?) then (yes)
  :Run isolation / flaky diagnosis;
endif

:Evaluate Test Quality Gate;

if (Every acceptance criterion and\nmandatory dimension satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Return PASS with evidence;
else (no)
  :Return FAIL / PARTIAL / BLOCKED with evidence;
endif

stop

note right
Coverage is diagnostic.
N/A needs a concrete reason.
Unexplained flaky retry is not PASS.
end note
@enduml
